    "body": "The guarded four-slot descriptor builder is now implemented: vanilla Attack, Magic, the supported character command, and the one-hot Single GF command. It covers every character and all 16 GF masks without invented substitutions; zero or legacy multi-GF masks leave the GF slot empty. The global toggle remains hidden because Switch and GF Magic pages are not complete.",
